  prompter script.md                  clean the script, open it full screen on the external monitor
  prompter script.md --screen DP-1    pick a monitor (connector or model name, e.g. ARZOPA)
  prompter script.md --wpm 140        starting speed in words per minute
  prompter script.md --narrow        narrow column near the lens (less eye travel)
  prompter script.md --text           also write the cleaned script next to it (script.prompter.txt)
  prompter script.md --no-open        only build the page
  prompter script.md --lang fr        interface language (en, fr)
  prompter script.md -- <flags>       extra flags passed to the browser as is

Keys: Space or click = play/pause (3 s countdown), Up/Down = speed, Left/Right = previous/next
paragraph, mouse wheel = scroll by hand, + / - = text size, Home = back to the start, M = mirror,
N = narrow column near the lens, F = full screen, H = help. Close with Alt+F4.
